{"seq":3,"slug":"intrinsic-vs-posthoc","title":"内在与事后解释","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/explainable-ai/foundations/intrinsic-vs-posthoc","wordCount":1714,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"内在与事后解释\">内在与事后解释</h1><p>面对一个新项目，可解释性的第一个真正的分叉点不是「用 LIME 还是 SHAP」，而是更早的一步：要不要一开始就选一个本身就透明的模型，还是先训一个黑箱再事后补解释。前者叫内在可解释（intrinsic），后者叫事后解释（post-hoc）。这道选择决定了你后面会不会用到本 hub 的全局和局部方法两章——如果模型自带透明结构，很多事后解释器你压根用不上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>可解释性的第一道分水岭是解释从哪来，而非用哪种算法。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>内在可解释（intrinsic）</strong>：可读性来自模型结构本身（线性系数、树路径、GAM 形状函数），无需额外算法，因此天然忠实于模型。</li>\n<li><strong>事后解释（post-hoc）</strong>：先训一个只追求精度的黑箱，再外挂独立解释器去近似它的行为；解释器只会看到黑箱的输入输出，给出的是对模型逻辑的「重建」。</li>\n<li><strong>核心差别在忠实性来源</strong>：内在解释就是模型本身，事后解释永远要回答「是否忠实于被解释模型」的拷问。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>内在可解释</th>\n<th>事后解释</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>可读性来源</td>\n<td>模型结构自带</td>\n<td>外挂解释器近似</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>忠实性</td>\n<td>天然忠实</td>\n<td>需单独验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型类</td>\n<td>线性/树/规则/GAM/EBM</td>\n<td>任意黑箱 + LIME/SHAP/反事实等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>系统复杂度</td>\n<td>一套模型要维护</td>\n<td>模型 + 解释器两套</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用数据</td>\n<td>表格结构化为主</td>\n<td>高维非结构化为主</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>理解这条分水岭后，选型才不会退化成「用 LIME 还是 SHAP」的工具之争——那是第二层问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"两条路线的本质区别\">两条路线的本质区别</h2><p>内在可解释模型的可读性来自模型结构本身。线性回归的系数直接就是每个特征的边际效应，决策树的一条根到叶路径就是一串可读的 if-then 规则——你不需要任何额外算法，看模型参数即可。</p>\n<p>事后解释则把模型和解释解耦：先不管可读性、只追求精度训出一个黑箱，再外挂一个独立的解释器（如 <a href=\"../local-methods/lime\">LIME</a>、<a href=\"../local-methods/shap\">SHAP</a>）去近似地说明它的行为。解释器看到的只是黑箱的输入输出，它给出的是对模型逻辑的「重建」，而非模型真正的内部逻辑。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Start[新建模任务] --&gt; Q{精度需求 vs 透明需求}&#10;    Q --&gt;|表格数据·需可审计| I[内在可解释路线]&#10;    Q --&gt;|高维数据·精度优先| P[事后解释路线]&#10;    I --&gt; I1[线性/逻辑回归]&#10;    I --&gt; I2[决策树/规则集]&#10;    I --&gt; I3[GAM / EBM]&#10;    P --&gt; P1[训练黑箱 GBDT/DNN]&#10;    P1 --&gt; P2[外挂事后解释器]&#10;    P2 --&gt; P3[全局方法]&#10;    P2 --&gt; P4[局部方法]&#10;    I3 --&gt; Done[可解释模型直接上线]&#10;    P3 --&gt; Done2[黑箱+解释一同上线]&#10;    P4 --&gt; Done2\">graph TD\n    Start[新建模任务] --&gt; Q{精度需求 vs 透明需求}\n    Q --&gt;|表格数据·需可审计| I[内在可解释路线]\n    Q --&gt;|高维数据·精度优先| P[事后解释路线]\n    I --&gt; I1[线性/逻辑回归]\n    I --&gt; I2[决策树/规则集]\n    I --&gt; I3[GAM / EBM]\n    P --&gt; P1[训练黑箱 GBDT/DNN]\n    P1 --&gt; P2[外挂事后解释器]\n    P2 --&gt; P3[全局方法]\n    P2 --&gt; P4[局部方法]\n    I3 --&gt; Done[可解释模型直接上线]\n    P3 --&gt; Done2[黑箱+解释一同上线]\n    P4 --&gt; Done2</pre><p>这个区别是关键：内在解释天然忠实于模型（它就是模型本身），事后解释则永远面临「解释是否忠实于被解释模型」的拷问——这也是为什么<a href=\"../practice/evaluation-trust\">评估与可信度</a>一篇主要是为事后解释服务的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见的玻璃箱模型\">常见的玻璃箱模型</h2><p>「内在可解释」不等于「弱」。下表列出几类玻璃箱模型，注意它们在精度与可读性上的梯度。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>可读形式</th>\n<th>能表达非线性</th>\n<th>能表达交互</th>\n<th>精度天花板</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>线性/逻辑回归</td>\n<td>系数即边际效应</td>\n<td>否（需手工特征）</td>\n<td>否（需手工交互项）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>决策树</td>\n<td>根到叶的规则路径</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>中（易过拟合）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规则集 / RuleFit</td>\n<td>if-then 规则列表</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>部分</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GAM</td>\n<td>每个特征一条形状函数</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否（默认）</td>\n<td>较高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EBM</td>\n<td>每特征+成对交互的形状函数</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是（成对）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>特别值得点名的是 <strong>EBM（Explainable Boosting Machine）</strong>，它是广义可加模型的现代版本：用梯度提升的方式为每个特征学一条形状函数，再额外学一批成对交互项。它保留了「看每个特征各自的曲线」这种玻璃箱可读性，精度却常能逼近随机森林和梯度提升树。这正印证了<a href=\"why-interpretability\">为什么需要可解释性</a>一篇里的论断：在结构化表格数据上，精度—可解释性的取舍常常并不存在。</p>\n<h2 id=\"gam-的数学形态\">GAM 的数学形态</h2><p>广义可加模型把线性模型的「系数乘特征」换成「每个特征一条任意形状的函数」，再加和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g(\\mathbb{E}[y]) = \\beta_0 + f_1(x_1) + f_2(x_2) + \\cdots + f_p(x_p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">])</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 是链接函数（回归用恒等、分类用 logit），每个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是只关于单个特征 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的形状函数。它依然可读，因为你可以把每条 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 单独画出来看——这其实就是<a href=\"../global-methods/partial-dependence\">部分依赖</a>曲线的「内在版本」，区别在于这里的曲线是模型结构本身，不是事后估计出来的。EBM 在此基础上再加上成对交互项 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{jk}(x_j, x_k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，把模型类从纯可加扩展到能捕捉两两交互。</p>\n<h2 id=\"怎么选-四个判据\">怎么选：四个判据</h2><p>不是「内在更好」也不是「事后更灵活」，而是看场景。</p>\n<p>第一，<strong>数据类型</strong>。表格结构化数据优先试内在模型（EBM 往往够用）；图像、文本、语音等高维非结构化数据，黑箱+事后解释几乎是唯一现实选择。</p>\n<p>第二，<strong>合规强度</strong>。高风险、需向当事人交代的场景（参见<a href=\"why-interpretability\">为什么需要可解释性</a>里的监管动机），内在模型的天然忠实性是巨大优势——你不必再额外证明解释器没撒谎。</p>\n<p>第三，<strong>精度差距</strong>。先用内在模型建一个基线，量出它和黑箱的精度差。如果差距小到可接受，没有理由为了一点点精度去背负事后解释的不忠实风险。</p>\n<p>第四，<strong>可维护性</strong>。事后解释引入了第二套需要单独验证和监控的系统（解释器本身会随数据漂移而失真）。内在模型只有一套东西要维护。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一个常见误区\">一个常见误区</h2><p>很多团队的默认流程是「先上黑箱，不行再补解释」，这往往是因为没认真试过内在模型。事后解释被当成了万能补丁，但它从来不是免费的：它增加了系统复杂度，且永远只是近似。更稳妥的顺序是反过来——先用 EBM/GAM 建可解释基线，只有当精度确实不够、且数据确实是高维非结构化时，才切到黑箱加事后解释，并准备好为解释的忠实性单独负责。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>内在可解释靠模型结构自身透明（线性、树、GAM、EBM），事后解释靠外挂解释器近似黑箱。</li>\n<li>内在解释天然忠实于模型，事后解释永远要回答「是否忠实」的拷问。</li>\n<li>EBM 是关键反例：玻璃箱可读性 + 逼近黑箱的精度，让表格数据上的取舍常常消失。</li>\n<li>GAM 的形状函数本质上是部分依赖曲线的「内在版本」。</li>\n<li>选型看数据类型、合规强度、精度差距、可维护性四个判据；默认「先黑箱后补解释」常是没试过内在模型的偷懒。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"内在与事后解释","id":"内在与事后解释"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"两条路线的本质区别","id":"两条路线的本质区别"},{"level":2,"text":"常见的玻璃箱模型","id":"常见的玻璃箱模型"},{"level":2,"text":"GAM 的数学形态","id":"gam-的数学形态"},{"level":2,"text":"怎么选：四个判据","id":"怎么选-四个判据"},{"level":2,"text":"一个常见误区","id":"一个常见误区"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"可解释性类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/explainable-ai/foundations/interpretability-types"},"next":{"title":"特征重要性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/explainable-ai/global-methods/feature-importance"}}